# What Vercel serves is this repository as it stands: the marketing site at
# the root, the app under /app, the shared rules the browser imports, and
# one function in /api. These have no business being downloadable.
#
# server/ and scripts/ are how the database gets built. They run against it
# from a checkout or a SQL editor, never from the deployment — and
# scripts/data.sql carries the administrator registration code, which a
# published copy would hand to anyone who guessed the path.
#
# app/README.md describes the internals and is for whoever works on this,
# not for the internet.
node_modules/
server/
scripts/
app/README.md
.env
.env.example
